# Backend build context = repo root. Keep backend/ and IVT2.0/ (incl. IVT2.0/outputs
# CSVs the Julia model reads). Exclude VCS, caches, virtualenvs and the frontend's
# node_modules so the image build stays lean.
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
.venv*
**/.venv
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
ivt-frontend/node_modules
ivt-frontend/build
*.db
README.md
QUICKSTART-DOCKER.md
